# Force LF in every working tree. Several tests read source, SQL and workflow
# files as text and search for "\n" (for example
# tests/hcm-compensation-architecture.test.ts), and migration checksums are
# computed over exact file bytes. Git for Windows' default core.autocrlf=true
# would otherwise rewrite these files to CRLF on checkout and break both.
* text=auto eol=lf
